         </property>
         <property name="text">
          <string>### Goal
Place **N queens** on an **NxN grid** so that no two queens are in conflict.

### Rules
Two queens must not:
- Be on the **same row**  
- Be on the **same column**  
- Be in the **same zone**  
- Be **adjacent** (neighboring cells, including diagonals)

### Tip
- You can place **dots** to mark forbidden cells.  
- The **auto-help** option can place these dots automatically when you place a queen.

### Controls
- **Left-click** to toggle between *(None → Dot → Queen)*. Hold and drag to place multiple **Dots**.  
- **Right-click** toggles in the opposite direction.
</string>
